OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AWhite House blocks Microsoft from
OL,4,Aforeign worker hiring program
OL,5,
OL,6,FVance claimed that Microsoft, one of
OL,7,Fthe most valuable companies in the US,
OL,8,Fhas been effectively replacing American
OL,9,Fworkers with "foreign indentured
OL,10,Fservants."
OL,12,FMicrosoft said most of the H1b visas
OL,13,Ffiled over the last financial year were
OL,14,Ffor existing workers, who are paid the
OL,15,Fsame as local staff.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
